OL,3,GNEWSAWoman injured in fatal police
OL,4,Apursuit crash dies
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who was critically injured when
OL,7,Fher car was in collision with a vehicle
OL,8,Finvolved in a police pursuit has died.
OL,10,FThe 62-year-old was the driver of a
OL,11,FFord Puma which collided with an Audi
OL,12,FA3 on the A439 Warwick Road near
OL,13,FStratford-upon-Avon in Warwickshire on
OL,14,FMonday.
OL,16,FThe driver of the Audi, a 19-year-old
OL,17,Fman, died at the scene. The Audi was
OL,18,Fbeing followed by police officers after
OL,19,Fit had earlier failed to pull over when
OL,20,Frequested to do so.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
